  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project, titled &#x201c;Energy resilience and security for the residential and public sector in Antigua and Barbuda,&#x201d; is supported through a Global Environment Facility (GEF) Project Preparation Grant (PPG) valued at USD 200,000. Its primary objective is to support the Government of Antigua and Barbuda in strengthening energy resilience and advancing energy security, particularly within residential and public sector infrastructure.The PPG focuses on the development and preparation of a full GEF-fun</narrative>
